c:"Six months",
a:["Thirty days","One year","Six months","Three months"],
e:"The Treasury announced a six-month initial grace period, along with exemptions for some telecommunications, software, pension and detainee-related transactions. The broader sanctions could otherwise restrict services provided to the court."
},
{
