c:"December 3",
a:["December 3","November 3","November 25","January 6"],
e:"Hasan’s execution by firing squad is scheduled for December 3. Republican lawmakers, religious leaders and human-rights groups objected to the proposed livestream, while Trump said Friday that he had not yet decided whether to permit it."
},
{
