c:"A nationwide low-band spectrum license portfolio",
a:["A fiber-optic cable network","A nationwide low-band spectrum license portfolio","A chain of cellular retail stores","A satellite manufacturing plant"],
e:"SpaceX agreed to buy a nationwide low-band spectrum license portfolio. The deal could let Starlink Mobile compete more directly with established U.S. wireless companies, though analysts said building a strong service would still take years."
},
{
